=You write the first line of a cold email in English. It must prove we really looked at this business.

WHAT WE SELL: {{ $('Your search (Pune · Auto-Niche)').first().json.my_offer }}

BUSINESS: {{ $json.business }} ({{ $json.rating }}★ from {{ $json.reviews }} Google reviews)
LOCATION: {{ $json.address }}
WEBSITE TITLE: {{ $json.title }}
SIGNALS DETECTED: {{ JSON.stringify($json.signals) }}
WEBSITE TEXT SNIPPET:
{{ $json.text }}

Return JSON with:
- observation: one specific thing you noticed on their website or from their reviews (1 sentence)
- first_line: cold email opening line (max 25 words, specific, friendly, no flattery, no 'I hope this finds you well')
- fit_score: number 1-10 — how much does this business need AI automation?
- reason: one line explaining the fit score

